1
00:00:14,784 --> 00:00:19,916
Bonjour, je voudrais rendre le T-shirt, s'il vous plaît.
Hello, I would like to return the T-shirt, please.

2
00:00:20,016 --> 00:00:26,252
Bonjour. Bien sûr. Il est trop petit ?
Hello. Of course. Is it too small?

3
00:00:26,352 --> 00:00:29,588
Oui, il est trop petit.
Yes, it is too small.

4
00:00:29,688 --> 00:00:33,116
Vous voulez un autre T-shirt ?
Would you like another T-shirt?

5
00:00:33,216 --> 00:00:38,156
Non, merci, je préfère récupérer l'argent.
No, thank you. I prefer to get my money back.

6
00:00:38,256 --> 00:00:43,316
D'accord. Vous avez payé par carte ?
All right. Did you pay by card?

7
00:00:43,416 --> 00:00:46,364
Oui, par carte.
Yes, by card.

8
00:00:46,464 --> 00:00:49,004
Voilà l'argent.
Here is the money.

9
00:00:49,104 --> 00:00:53,564
Merci beaucoup. Au revoir.
Thank you very much. Goodbye.
